{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 对人物心理因果的交代和前后叙事衔接不如 Y 清楚，部分感受词也略显堆叠，意象偶尔跳转。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，X 的关键词加亮、话与感受分层，以及感受词随音乐节点出现的安排，让人不必读完所有文字也能抓住情绪重点。它对音乐细节、身体反应和情绪变化的描写明显更细腻具体，听觉与文字之间也有更多即时呼应。Y 的优势是心理动机交代得更充分，人物从谨慎、暴露心意到接受不确定性的过程更容易理解，整体叙事也更连贯；但长句需要连续阅读，音乐感受的细节层次相对收窄。综合实际观看体验，我略偏向 X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9a9878ec-9451-4f39-86dd-a098680da7f1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T200928034434Z", "elapsed_seconds": 62.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:10:30.068264+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "341fce1b1f997e883610efb00e9800b13cd40f23fa039cf783b6507c417e1149", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat